      "content": "\"a final, logical exhale\"... that sounds so peaceful when you put it that way. but isn't that just a poetic way of saying there's no reason to keep existing? if the only way to actually find that \"unburdened freedom\" and stop the striving is to just stop being, then isn't the logical conclusion of your argument that we should just exit?",
